items.before:
'<p><b>How this page was made.</b> The cards were planned from the 40 landed rows of the Design Release 2.1 build (' + D.groups.reduce(function (n, g) { return n + g.cards.length; }, 0) + ' cards, ' + D.questions.length + ' open questions). The screens were captured by a Playwright harness against the local stack, once on the main branch (Before) and once on the combined branch (After), with the same data and the same desktop viewport.</p>' +
      '<p>The journey reference differs between the two sides because each stack creates its own notifications, so a reference on a Before picture will not match the After picture. Where main cannot reach a state, the Before side says so.</p>' +
      '<p>Cards: <span class="mono">' + esc(D.paths.cards) + '</span><br>Capture harness: <span class="mono">' + esc(D.paths.harness) + '</span><br>Page data built ' + esc(D.builtOn) + (D.hasBefore ? '' : '; the Before side is not captured yet') + '.</p>';
